  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Category:</strong> Luxury</p>\n<p><strong>Fabrication:</strong> DV29 - 5,000eb - 1 Month</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible:</strong> All Non-Explosive Tech Weapons</p>\n<p><em>This is Militech overcompensating for losing the electromag arms race to Tsunami Arms by using an overcharged supercapacitor array to turn a tech weapon into a man-portable massdriver.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Iconic Weapon Mod.</strong> When making a charged Tech Rebuild Attack with the weapon, it deals 1d6 additional Single Shot damage, has its Autofire Rating (if any) increased by 1, can see simple target outlines through and fire through up to one layer of Thick Cover if it could not already do so, and if it would ablate armor, ablates 2 additional SP.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Iconic: it can't be bought or sourced on the street, can't be fabricated without its Blueprint, can't be taken during Character Generation, and once acquired can't be destroyed unless the player agrees to it beforehand.</li>\n<li>The price is the Luxury benchmark, for working out repairs and Tech Upgrades. Iconics can't be bought.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Becoming Iconic &gt; Iconic Weapons).</em></p>"
